[main]
phraseStart=""".method public startWallet(Z)V"""
phraseEnd=.end method
replaceWith="""
.method public startWallet(Z)V
    .registers 5

    const-string v0, "double_press_power_key"

    invoke-static {v0}, Lcom/android/vsteam/Toolbox;->getStrGlobal(Ljava/lang/String;)Ljava/lang/String;

    move-result-object v0

    const-string v1, "Double Press Power Key"

    invoke-static {v0, v1}, Lcom/android/vsteam/Toolbox;->Handle_VS_Action(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;)V
    return-void
.end method
""" 
